ber’s path, individually","html_id":"every-members-path-individually","implicit":true,"key":"Xl2lybOkxW"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Each line is one ensemble member’s 2m temperature at Munich over the\nrollout. Unlike a boxplot, this shows whether spread comes from a few\noutlier members or a broad, even spread across all of them.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"LiwBD4s46N"}],"key":"x8TZM6lba5"}],"key":"rZrDklbwyt"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-07-24T11:17:05.970924Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-07-24T11:17:05.970714Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-07-24T11:17:06.729241Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-07-24T11:17:06.728523Z"}},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"munich = nearest_point(ds, MUNICH_LAT, MUNICH_LON)\nt2m_munich = drop_time(munich[\"t2m\"]).transpose(\"lead_time\", \"ensemble\").compute().values - 273.15\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(14, 5))\nfor i in range(t2m_munich.shape[1]):\n    ax.plot(x_hours, t2m_munich[:, i], color=COLOR_MEMBER, alpha=0.6, linewidth=1.0)\nax.plot(x_hours, t2m_munich.mean(axis=1), color=COLOR_MEAN, linewidth=2.5, label=\"Ensemble mean\")\nax.set_xlabel(\"Lead time (hours)\")\nax.set_ylabel(\"Temperature (deg C)\")\nax.set_title(\"Munich - 2m temperature, every ensemble member\")\nax.legend(loc=\"best\")\nax.grid(True, color=\"#DDDDDD\", linewidth=0.6)\nfig.tight_layout()\nfig.savefig(paths.ensemble_book_path / \"spaghetti_t2m_munich.png\", dpi=150, bbox_inches=\"tight\")\nplt.show()","key":"p3PL92OWlw"},{"type":"outputs","id":"dhGfwUYKXs0OV__IIZBBh","children":[],"key":"IS4b99sMfL"}],"key":"dQ6M5kXB1v"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"container","kind":"figure","children":[{"type":"image","url":"/e2s-examples/build/spaghetti_t2m_munich-815ae543533836801b1b00c72b504c